          "text": "Julia’s remark, {i}“puerī mē rīdent”{/i} (l.70), shows that {i}rīdet{/i}, which is usually an intransitive verb, can take an object in the sense “laugh at”: {i}Puerī Iūliam rīdent.{/i}"
